# interactive: no synthetic touches, for a person holding the phone.
#
# The lock screen is dismissed by libredwood-sb26.dylib inside SpringBoard. rwsh runs what the host
# sends with tools/k90auto/rsh.py (kernel 12377-cmd1 or later, loader v10, PAYLOAD_PROGRAMS naming
# the rwsh binary). lsprobe answers which applications LaunchServices knows, framewatch prints frame
# counts every 20 s, and nothing else touches the screen, so every gesture in the log is the
# person's own.
/redwood/bin/rwsh &
/redwood/bin/lsprobe 60 &
/redwood/bin/framewatch --every 20 --count 120 SpringBoard backboardd &
